<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55483" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταφαν-ής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>clearly seen, in
			sight</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔπω κ. ἦσαν οἱ πολέμιοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					1.8.8
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Eq.Mag.</u>
				7.8
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν κ. στρατοπεδεύεσθαι</span> in
				<i>an open place</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				3.3.28
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>manifest, evident</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ποιέειν τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.120
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				11.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Grg.</u>
				453c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				1.6.14
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ἐστί τι, γίγνεταί τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Off.</u>
					3
				</span></i>
			: 
				Comp.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				812a
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				186e
			</span></i>, etc.: freq. c. part., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταφανέες εἰσὶ ἁμαρτάνοντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>VM</u>
					1
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ἦντῇ βουλῇ αὐτὸς θεὶς τὴν
					ἱκετηρίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					And.
					1.116
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				2.39
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				2.1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ἐγένοντο οὐχ ὅσιοι ὄντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antipho
					5.82
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				7.12.8
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταφανέστερος εἶναι κακουργῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					5.16
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ἐστί τις, ὅτι</span> . .
				<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Plt.</u>
				265d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>R.</u>
				506b
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. γίγνονται, ὅτι</span> . .
				<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				1.20
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ποιεῖν τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antiph.
					235.6
				</span></i>
			. Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νῶς</span>
			<i>evidently, plainly</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				943
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				35.27
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταφανέστερον ἢ ὥστε λανθάνειν</span>
			<i>too manifestly</i> to escape detection, Th <i><span class="en">
				8.46
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
